### Create a new coach
POST http://localhost:8080/api/coaches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clubId": 1,
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "Bianchi",
  "documentNumber": "11222333",
  "age": 55,
  "dateOfBirth": "1970-04-26",
  "photoUrl": "https://storage.example.com/photos/carlos-bianchi.jpg"
}

### Create a coach without photo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/coaches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clubId": 2,
  "firstName": "Marcelo",
  "lastName": "Gallardo",
  "documentNumber": "22333444",
  "age": 49,
  "dateOfBirth": "1976-01-18"
}

### Get all coaches for a club (replace with actual club ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/coaches?clubId=1

### Get coach by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/coaches/1

### Update a coach (replace with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/coaches/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "Bianchi",
  "documentNumber": "11222333",
  "age": 56,
  "dateOfBirth": "1970-04-26",
  "photoUrl": "https://storage.example.com/photos/carlos-bianchi-updated.jpg"
}

### Delete a coach (replace with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/coaches/1
